      ],
      "en": "When he made mention of God’s ark, Eli fell from off his seat backward by the side of the gate; and his neck broke, and he died, for he was an old man and heavy. He had judged Israel forty years.",
      "ko": "하나님의 궤를 말할 때에 엘리가 자기 의자에서 자빠져 문 곁에서 목이 부러져 죽었으니 나이 많고 비둔한 연고라 그가 이스라엘 사사가 된지 사십년이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "3437fb488b00ccf142fd162fd4fa6a68b66a1935ff19eba7406bbcc6c68766cf",
      "translation_text_hash": "4e48f13bb802ab6417f2b6f9222d6387c1aac241208d0b8fac680ea4c89eb420",
